1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,080
Narrator: Listen to a teacher talking to a class.

2
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:11,030
I'm pleased to announce that our own Betsy Phillips has been elected as the president of the eighth grade class.

3
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:14,904
I'm so proud that someone from our homeroom has taken the position

4
00:00:14,904 --> 00:00:19,100
and I know how much work some of you put into helping Betsy.

5
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:21,070
Congratulations, everybody.

6
00:00:21,070 --> 00:00:24,270
Betsy, I'm sure you'll do a great job.
